    "intro_narrative": "Welcome, traveler, to the forgotten Sanctuary of the Archmage. Here, magic and arcane machinery intertwine, guarding secrets long thought lost to the ages. The Archmage sealed his ultimate treasure, The Royal Seal, deep within this sanctum before his sudden disappearance. You stand in the grand antechamber, surrounded by cryptic artifacts, silent constructs, and enchanted stones. Your objective is clear: navigate this labyrinth of arcane logic, harness the powers of ancient relics, and retrieve the Seal. But beware, the path is fraught with interwoven wards and dependencies. You must decipher the flows of magical energy and figure out which artifacts awaken each other. Trust your intuition and intellect to conquer the sanctuary's trials and prove your worth.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
